    <h2>What Is the Swicy Pineapple with Tajín® Blizzard® Treat?</h2>
    <p>The Swicy Pineapple with Tajín® Blizzard is unlike any other Blizzard on the DQ menu. "Swicy" — sweet plus spicy — is the defining flavor concept. Pineapple topping delivers tropical sweetness, and Tajín® chili-lime seasoning adds a tangy heat that builds slightly. In cold soft serve, the combination is genuinely refreshing rather than aggressive. It is the most adventurous seasonal Blizzard DQ has launched and the lightest-calorie of the Summer 2026 group at 430 cal (Small).</p>
  <p>For the complete DQ menu including all seasonals, visit <a href="/">The Queen Dairy Menu</a>.</p>

    <h2>Who Should Order the Swicy Pineapple Tajín® Blizzard</h2>
  <ul>
    <li><strong>Order this if:</strong> You enjoy bold flavor combinations, like spicy-sweet food, or are curious about an unusual DQ offering. If you use Tajín® on fruit or are a hot sauce fan, this is your summer Blizzard.</li>
    <li><strong>Skip it if:</strong> You prefer traditional sweet desserts without any heat. The Tajín does add noticeable spice — not painful, but clearly present.</li>
  </ul>
  <h2>The Lowest-Calorie Summer 2026 Blizzard</h2>
  <p>At 430 cal for a Small, the Swicy Pineapple Tajín® Blizzard is the lightest-calorie Blizzard in the Summer 2026 lineup — even lighter than the <a href="/items/cotton-candy-blizzard">Cotton Candy Blizzard</a> at 460 cal. The pineapple topping adds flavor without the calorie density of candy or chocolate mix-ins.</p>

    <h2>How It Compares to Other Blizzards</h2>
    <div class="table-wrap"><table class="size-table"><thead><tr><th>Blizzard</th><th>Mini Price</th><th>Small Cal</th><th>Flavor Profile</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td>Swicy Pineapple Tajín®</td><td class="price-cell">$4.49</td><td>430</td><td>Boldest, lightest-calorie summer seasonal</td></tr><tr><td>Cotton Candy Blizzard</td><td class="price-cell">$4.49</td><td>460</td><td>Lightest flavor, sweet only</td></tr><tr><td>S'mores Blizzard</td><td class="price-cell">$4.49</td><td>500</td><td>Traditional comfort flavors</td></tr><tr><td>Dipped Strawberry Cheesecake</td><td class="price-cell">$4.49</td><td>540</td><td>Richest summer seasonal</td></tr></tbody></table></div>

    <h2>Ordering Tips</h2>
    <ul>
      <li><strong>First timer?</strong> Order a Mini (4.49) — it's 4–5 spoonfuls, perfect for a taste test before committing to a full cup.</li>
      <li><strong>Best size for one person:</strong> Small (5.29) at 430 calories hits the sweet spot of satisfaction without going overboard.</li>
      <li><strong>Upgrade option:</strong> Ask to blend in a hot fudge swirl for richer chocolate depth, or add extra mix-ins (~$0.50).</li>
      <li><strong>Check the flip:</strong> DQ guarantees every Blizzard is thick enough to hold upside down — if your crew doesn't flip it, it's free.</li>
    </ul>

